  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The plot of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>logk</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></msub></math> versus <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mfrac></math> for a reversible reaction <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8652;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>)</mo></math> is shown.</p><p><img src=\"assets\\qt0003_51a54b777d9f.png\" style=\"width: 296px; height: 216px;\" /></p><p>Pre-exponential factors for the forward and backward reactions are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>15</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>11</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>, respectively. If the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>logK</mi></math> for the reaction at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>500</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn></math>, the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><msub><mi>logk</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></msub></mfenced></math> at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>250</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math> is<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mo>=</mo></mrow></mfenced></math>equilibrium constant of the reaction, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></msub><mo>=</mo></math>rate constant of forward reaction, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></msub><mo>=</mo></math>rate constant of backward reaction]</p>"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "5",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>From the question<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>15</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>11</mn></msup><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext>&#160;Forward reaction&#160;</mtext></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>logK</mi><mtext>&#160;at&#160;</mtext><mn>500</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></mtd><mtd><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext>&#160;Backward reaction&#160;</mtext></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>logk</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></msub><mtext>&#160;at&#160;</mtext><mn>500</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mtext>&#160;(from graph)&#160;</mtext></mtd><mtd></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>logk</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></msub><mtext>&#160;at&#160;</mtext><mn>500</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mo>:</mo></mtd><mtd></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>logK</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>log</mi><mfenced><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></msub></mfrac></mfenced><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mtext>&#160;since&#160;</mtext><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></msub></mfrac></mtd><mtd></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>logk</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>logk</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>logk</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>log</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mtext>&#160;at&#160;</mtext><mn>500</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>log</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></msub></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>&#8722;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></msub><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mfrac><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi>ab</mi></msub></mrow><mi>RT</mi></mfrac></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>ln</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></msub><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mfrac><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi>ab</mi></msub></mrow><mi>RT</mi></mfrac></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>lnk</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>lnA</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi>ab</mi></msub><mi>RT</mi></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>303</mn><msub><mi>logk</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>303</mn><msub><mi>logA</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi>ab</mi></msub><mrow><mn>500</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></msub><mrow><mn>500</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>303</mn><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>logA</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>logk</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></msub></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></msub><mrow><mn>500</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>303</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>log</mi><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>11</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></msub><mrow><mn>500</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>303</mn><mo>(</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>303</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>8</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>303</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>500</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></msub></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mrow><mn>250</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mrow><mn>500</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></msub></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>250</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>500</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mrow><mn>250</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mrow><mn>500</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>303</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>500</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mfrac><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>500</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>303</mn><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>logk</mi><mrow><mn>250</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi